    "text": "Sulphur Springs\nGreenview Memorial Day Business Meeting and Church Service 2025\nBy KSST Webmaster,\n3 hours agoWe would like to invite everyone to the 2024 Greenview Memorial Day business meeting and church service. Our business meeting will start on Sunday July 7th at 10:30AM with David Burns preaching the sermon. Chad Hinton will serve at the MC. Jan Kimmel will give a presentation. Woody Garmon and Pat Looney will lead the singing.",
